<title>USA: Donna Karan Q3 pro forma shr rises to $0.61.</title>
<headline>Donna Karan Q3 pro forma shr rises to $0.61.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.61		    $0.52</p>
<p> Net			 12,991		   11,174</p>
<p> Revs		     173,415		  152,389</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,468		   21,468</p>
<p>	  12 months</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.82		    $0.67</p>
<p> Net			 17,656		   14,409</p>
<p> Revs		     450,641		  370,292</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  21,468		   21,468</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Figures are proforma results assuming the company's initial public offering completed July 3 had been completed on the first day of fiscal 1995 and give effect to the reorganization, the offering and other adjustments.</p>
<p>Full company name is Donna Karan International Inc.</p>
